          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्राध्यापक — prādhyāpak — \"a professor\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आमचे प्राध्यापक खूप छान शिकवतात. āmce prādhyāpak khūp chān śikavtāt. Our professor teaches very well."
